  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6662158236049980159}
  m_Text: 'SOLID = dark ground       ONE-WAY INTENTION = amber ledge

    PLACEHOLDER
    = magenta / no collision or runtime behavior

    Measured reference: run 5.2
    units/s | jump rise 2.24 | double rise 3.66

    Previously tested level-ground
    gaps: 2.0 / 2.75 / 3.5 units

    This room has no player, checkpoint, moving
    platform or parallax behavior yet.'
